# The specification's second example; vtium supports X=1.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "The terminal emulator will include in its reply every key from the feature query that has a non-default value which it supports for that action, with that value, as well as e itself"
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=q,i=31,e=f,r=1,X=1\e\\"
